msgstr "已归档：Mission Planner 终端"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:9
#: 756f68c4c3174f12a908c5224bdb8ba9
msgid ""
"The CLI is being phased out on all platforms. The features were massively "
"cut down with AC3.1.5 and then it was removed for the APM2 completely anyway"
" with AC3.2. All CLI functions are now available via regular MAVLink "
"commands in the GCSs. This article has been moved to the dev wiki and may be"
" considered deprecated."
msgstr ""
"CLI 正在所有平台上逐步淘汰。其功能在 AC3.1.5 中被大幅削减，在 AC3.2 中又彻底从 APM2 上移除。所有 CLI "
"功能现在可通过地面站中的常规 MAVLink 命令使用。本文已移至开发 wiki，可视为已废弃。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:15
#: 9fb0ab5939f347c39cd14e7639e780f0
msgid ""
"The Terminal tab is visible on the top icon row when \"Advanced View\" is "
"checked in the Config tab."
msgstr "在 Config 标签页中勾选「Advanced View」后，Terminal 标签页将显示在顶部图标行。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:21
#: 1602f7c7a76d47b9bc53da1a575899e3
msgid ""
"This section of Mission Planner, invoked by the Menu item Terminal at the "
"top of Mission Planner, opens a window that allows communication with the "
"auto pilot in a 'terminal' mode. This mode allows many actions specific to "
"the auto pilot and specific to the control firmware in the autopilot. "
"Copter, Plane and rovers will have different options. Refer to the vehicle "
"specific area of the website for details about your specific platform."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 顶部菜单项 Terminal "
"可调出此功能区，打开一个允许以「终端」模式与飞控通信的窗口。此模式允许执行飞控及其控制固件特有的许多操作。多旋翼、固定翼和地面车将有不同的选项，请参阅网站上对应飞行器的专区了解您特定平台的详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:29
#: 86faeb56bddc41d8b782516e48d46409
msgid ""
"Note:  When you open this menu item, the connection to your APM or PX4 will "
"not be changed.  If connected, you will remain connected. This is to prevent"
" loss of control in case you are in a mission or your vehicle is armed and "
"in operation.  You must click the Connect APM or Connect PX4 button to use "
"the features in this screen."
msgstr ""
"注意：打开此菜单项时，与您的 APM 或 PX4 "
"的连接不会改变。如果已连接，连接将保持。这是为了防止在执行任务或飞行器已解锁运行时失去控制。必须点击「Connect APM」或「Connect "
"PX4」按钮才能使用此界面的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:38
#: 631450aa225e4394817c9c5e937a05bc
msgid ""
"Screen Actions:  There are several buttons in this screen.  Here is the "
"function of each:"
msgstr "界面操作：此界面有多个按钮，各按钮功能如下："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:41
#: f4a201a329f84a9694c73d96f0d45bd3
msgid "Connect APM:  Reboot the APM in CLI mode and enable this screen."
msgstr "Connect APM：以 CLI 模式重启 APM 并启用此界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:42
#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:44
#: 33e21a972f4e4bcf869c3e5865c98426 95b205e3ce5841e59e11689e63c0173b
msgid "Caution, previous connection will be lost."
msgstr "注意，之前的连接将会断开。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:43
#: 80570839db2f4f2b9358122d7a1eb5b6
msgid "Connect PX4:  Reboot the PX4 in CLI mode and enable this screen."
msgstr "Connect PX4：以 CLI 模式重启 PX4 并启用此界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:45
#: 28b51768125f45408902753678fd2660
msgid ""
"Show Settings: This simply lists all the parameters in your auto pilot.  "
"Better to use the Configuration Tuning section of Mission Planner"
msgstr ""
"Show Settings：列出自动驾驶仪中的所有参数。建议使用 Mission Planner 的 Configuration Tuning 部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:48
#: 9163d4425be64275afd49ef29dead7f2
msgid ""
"Setup Radio: Goes to the setup section, radio and allows you to set up the "
"radio.  Better to use the Confiuration Tuning section of Mission Planner but"
" sometimes this is useful."
msgstr ""
"Setup Radio：进入设置部分的遥控器设置，允许配置遥控器。建议使用 Mission Planner 的 Configuration Tuning"
" 部分，但有时此功能也很有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:51
#: 1dd1682bb6cf4893b6680915a4940a0f
msgid ""
"Tests: Goes to the tests section of CLI and lists the options. You can type "
"any of the options, press Enter to run the test."
msgstr "Tests：进入 CLI 的测试部分并列出选项。可以输入任意选项，按 Enter 运行测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:53
#: 3797464e9fe5403197ebfd677241fa63
msgid ""
"Log Download: Opens a new screen for downloading and performing other "
"actions related to the Flash Data logs that are recorded in the auto pilot. "
"These logs are recorded when the APM or PX4 is enabled and stopped when it "
"is disabled.  See the links below for more information."
msgstr ""
"Log Download：打开新界面，用于下载自动驾驶仪中记录的 Flash 数据日志及执行相关操作。这些日志在 APM 或 PX4 "
"启用时开始记录，禁用时停止。详情参见下方链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:58
#: 31bbd8d54ccb40ed8e4125a2e4fc3454
msgid ""
"Log Browse:  Lets you open a log file  (file with extension .log) that was "
"previously saved and graph the various parameters that were recorded.  See "
"the Data Flash Logs link below for more detail."
msgstr ""
"Log Browse：允许打开之前保存的日志文件（扩展名为 .log），并绘制所记录的各种参数图表。详情参见下方 Data Flash 日志链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-terminal.rst:62
#: 285df94608b34365b2fc5bcd9a017110
msgid "Here is where you will find other details:"
msgstr "以下是其他详细信息的位置："

